This is an original, clean-room implementation. bastionkit is inspired only by
the publicly known concept of a hardened Kubernetes "secure cluster baseline"
and package framework. It does not copy, fork, vendor, or incorporate any
third-party source code, configuration, documentation text, names, logos, or
trademarks. The baseline controls reference publicly published hardening
guidance (the CIS Kubernetes Benchmark families and the NSA/CISA Kubernetes
Hardening Guidance) by concept only; no third-party copyrighted text is
reproduced.

This product bundles no third-party code. It requires only the Python standard
library.
